                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface mb-1">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary-container">all_inbox</span> Hộp hoa cao cấp (Boxes)</span>
